<title>USA: Tuscarora buys Ohio packaging company.</title>
<headline>Tuscarora buys Ohio packaging company.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRIGHTON, Pa. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuscarora Inc said Wednesday it bought FormPac Corp, a Sandusky, Ohio, manufacturer of custom thermoformed packaging, for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Tuscarora makes material handling pallets and protective packaging. The company said FormPac makes and supplies packaging to industrial consumers.</p>
<p>Tuscarora said FormPac has annual sales of about $6 million. Tuscarora said its combined sales of thermoformed packaging products after the purchase will be more than $10 million.</p>
</text>
